---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
import { byPhotoId } from '../data/gallery';

const card = byPhotoId('DSC01783');

const notes = [
  {
    n: '01',
    title: 'The room is the argument',
    body: `Twenty round tables and a low stage. No auditorium rake, no back row to hide in,
    no seat far from a faculty member. You can read a conference's real thesis off its floor
    plan, and this one says the learning happens sideways.`,
  },
  {
    n: '02',
    title: 'Values before tactics',
    body: `The 2026 meeting is titled Strong Ground, and the programming keeps returning to
    the same order of operations: work out what you actually value, then choose the practice,
    the partners and the technology. Most of medicine's business advice runs that backwards.`,
  },
  {
    n: '03',
    title: 'Technology arrives as a leadership question',
    body: `Artificial intelligence turns up on the agenda not as a product demo but as a
    management problem — what it does to training, to how a team is built, to the shape of a
    patient's visit. That is a more useful frame than another tool comparison.`,
  },
];
---

<section class="section on-night" id="notes">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionHead num="04" label="Field notes" title="Three things worth writing down.">
      <p class="prose">
        Observations, not reporting. What follows is one attendee's reading of the room.
      </p>
    </SectionHead>

    <div class="notes__grid">
      <ol class="notes__list">
        {notes.map((note, i) => (
          <li class="note reveal" style={`--reveal-delay:${i * 80}ms`}>
            <span class="label note__n">{note.n}</span>
            <h3 class="h3 note__t">{note.title}</h3>
            <p class="note__b">{note.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>

      <div class="notes__media">
        <figure class="reveal">
          <div class="frame notes__frame">
            <Image
              src={card.image}
              alt={card.alt}
              widths={[400, 600, 720]}
              sizes="(min-width: 62rem) 26rem, min(28rem, calc(100vw - 2.5rem))"
              quality={84}
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="notes__cap">
            Left on the entrepreneurship table, beside a bowl of Pop Rocks.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <blockquote class="pull reveal">
          <p class="serif-note">
            “Leadership isn’t always quiet. Sometimes the best ideas make a little noise.”
          </p>
          <cite class="notes__cap">Printed table card, LEADderm 2026</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .notes__grid {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }
  @media (min-width: 62rem) {
    .notes__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 26rem; align-items: start; }
  }

  .notes__list { display: grid; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-on-night); }
  .note {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding-block: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-on-night);
  }
  .note__n { color: var(--ink-2-on-night); }
  .note__t { color: var(--ink-on-night); }
  .note__b {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--ink-2-on-night);
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .notes__media { display: grid; gap: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); max-width: 28rem; }
  @media (min-width: 62rem) { .notes__media { max-width: none; } }
  .notes__frame { background: var(--night-soft); }
  .notes__cap {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: #83868c;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .pull {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--pine-bright);
  }
</style>
